  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; \">Nicol&aacute;s Bujeda Cabrera, responsable de protocolo y relaciones p&uacute;blicas</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; \">&nbsp;del&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.consorciomuseos.es/\" style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; \">Consorcio de Museos de la Comunitat Valenciana</a></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; \">, el&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; \">diputado provincial de Cultura, H&eacute;ctor Folgado, y el alcalde de Onda, Salvador Aguilella</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; \">&nbsp;han inaugurado esta tarde la muestra&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; \">&lsquo;Vigreyos. Ceramista&rsquo;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 30, 28); font-family: verdana; text-align: justify; \">en el Museo del Taulell &quot;Manolo Safont&quot; de Onda.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpovigreyosmuseutaulell/img_4051.jpg\" alt=\"img_4051\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpovigreyosmuseutaulell/img_4052.jpg\" alt=\"img_4052\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpovigreyosmuseutaulell/img_4053.jpg\" alt=\"img_4053\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpovigreyosmuseutaulell/img_4054.jpg\" alt=\"img_4054\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><im